      "source": "Interceptor enforcing required return value and method parameter constraints declared on repository query methods.\nSupports Kotlin nullness markers, JSpecify, and JSR-305 Non-null annotations. Originally implemented via\n<a href=\"../repository/core/support/MethodInvocationValidator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>MethodInvocationValidator</code></a>.",
      "translation": "拦截器，用于强制实施在仓库查询方法上声明的返回值和方法参数约束。支持 Kotlin 空值标记、JSpecify 以及 JSR-305 非空注解。最初通过 <a href=\"../repository/core/support/MethodInvocationValidator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.core.support\"><code>MethodInvocationValidator</code></a> 实现。",
      "count": 1
    },
